export anchor MidnightNavyStyle:
    number: 225
    screen: ProjectsDashboard
    name: Midnight navy
    idea: Deep blue-black surfaces cut by crisp 1px hairlines, cool ice text and one ice cyan accent, laid out as a precise ruled instrument with a top nav and thin light figures.
    base: dark
    palette:
        night: #070d1c, the page, the table ground and the style sheet
        panel: #0c1529, the masthead and swatch cells
        hairline: #1e2d4d, row rules, cell dividers and grid lines
        rule: #2e4370, section rules, the masthead edge and outlined controls
        ice: #dde8ff, text and figures
        frost: #93a6c9, labels, meta and axis text
        cyan: #8fd3ff, the primary button, the current tab, progress ticks, the this week line and focus
        onCyan: #03172a, text on the cyan button
        focusHalo: #13284a, a 4px halo outside the focus outline
        lastWeek: #6c7fa6, the dashed last week line and empty ticks
        ok: #6ee7b7, the On track word and check circle
        risk: #fcd34d, the At risk word and triangle
        bad: #fca5a5, Behind, the overdue box and the overdue figure
    type:
        Segoe UI first, then system-ui, Roboto, Helvetica Neue and Arial,
        with ui-monospace for times and dates. Base 14px. The greeting is
        30px at 300 with the name at 600, the four figures 40px at 200 with
        tabular numbers, section and column labels 11px caps tracked 0.14em,
        and status words 12px caps at 700 tracked 0.1em.
    layout:
        A full-width masthead on the panel tone holds an outlined cyan B
        square, the name, six text tabs with a 2px cyan underline on Home,
        then search, New project, a square bell and an outlined initials
        square with Mara Okafor. The body is one 1240px column. The date
        sits as a small caps label over Good morning, Mara, and on the right
        a red outlined box reads 4 tasks are overdue with a clock. The four
        figures are one strip ruled above and below and split by vertical
        hairlines, the overdue figure red. Projects is a full-width hairline
        table with columns for project, team, a ten-tick progress meter with
        percent, tasks, due and a status word in caps. Below, two columns
        hold Throughput, a line chart with last week dashed with round dots
        and this week solid cyan with square dots, and an Activity log whose
        times sit in a mono column on the left. Below 900px the tabs move
        to their own scrolling row. Below 700px a search field sits above
        the greeting, the figures go two by two and table rows stack.
    spacing: An 8px unit. 12px cell padding, 40 to 48px between sections, 24px gutters.
    density: Medium. Everything is one ruled column, then chart and log side by side.
    corners: 2px on buttons and fields. Everything else is square.
    borders: 1px hairlines everywhere, #1e2d4d between rows and cells and #2e4370 above and below each section.
    shadows: None. Depth comes only from hairlines and the panel tone of the masthead.
    icons:
        Square-capped line icons at 1.5 stroke, 16px. Progress is ten small
        outlined ticks, filled cyan for each tenth done. Status is a check
        circle, a triangle or a crossed square beside the word in caps.
    focus: A 1px cyan outline offset 2px plus a 4px deep blue halo.
    tone: Precise and instrument-like, such as Throughput, Activity log and Projects · 6 active.
